I think the hyperparameters are flawed because the accuracy is measured on imbalanced data. The model is optimized to predict the majority class which is the black pixels.

The way we sample synth data is by sampling random noise and random target pixels. The teacher model does not have the capability of reconstructing the target, it was trained to draw digits not random noise.  


